	(55, 206, 'Reverse Linked List', 'easy', '{linked-list,recursion,two-pointer}', '["Iterative 三 pointer 節奏：save next → flip curr.next = prev → walk prev → walk curr", "next_node 只是書籤：在 curr.next = prev 蓋掉之前先存住下一站", "Recursive base case: head is None or head.next is None — 兩個都要 cover", "Recursive 核心：head.next 同時是『原本下一個』也是『反轉子串列的尾巴』，所以 head.next.next = head 接得上", "new_head 從最深層 base case 一路原封不動傳上來；每層只做收尾一小步"]', 'Iterative O(n) time O(1) space; recursive O(n) time O(n) space (call stack)', '["Ship 哪個？— Iterative，Python 預設 recursion limit ~1000 長 list 會爆 stack", "Recursive 思考框架？— 定義 base case → 信任子問題 → 只做當層多出來那一點點工", "下一題試 LC 92 區間反轉 — https://leetcode.com/problems/reverse-linked-list-ii/"]', '["Iterative: 寫 curr.next = prev 之前一定要先 save next_node，否則 list 後半永久遺失", "Iterative: while 結束時 curr 是 None，要 return prev 不是 curr", "Recursive: head.next.next = head 之後一定要 head.next = None，否則最後兩個 node 形成 cycle"]', '2026-04-22 04:37:04.79955+00', '2026-05-09 08:12:35.447+00', 'Given the head of a singly linked list, reverse the list and return the new head.', 'Input: head = [1,2,3,4,5]
Output: [5,4,3,2,1]', '["卡住時馬上畫 1 → 2 → 3 + prev/curr/next 三個 pointer，zoom in 到當下這個 node，別在腦中追整個 list", "Iterative 別加 if not head: return head — 是 dead code，while 迴圈本身就 handle 空 list", "Recursive 別 thread accumulator helper(head, prev_node) — 是偽 iteration、白賠 O(n) stack；真正遞迴是信任子問題而不是帶狀態往前走"]', 2),
	(33, 20, 'Valid Parentheses', 'easy', '{string,stack}', '["用 stack：遇左括號 push，遇右括號 check top 配不配", "mapping 用 right → left 一個 dict 就夠，不要嵌套", "右括號來時 stack 空 or top 不配 → return False", "掃完檢查 stack 是否為空，不空代表有左括號沒關"]', 'O(n) time, O(n) space', '["為什麼用 stack？— 最近打開的括號必須最先關，LIFO 剛好吻合", "只有一種括號時？— 計數器就夠，不用 stack"]', '["右括號來時 stack 可能是空的，要先檢查才能 peek", "return 直接寫 not stack，不要 True if len==0 else False", "別用嵌套 dict 分 left/right — 一個 right→left mapping 就搞定"]', '2026-04-16 11:56:15.119069+00', '2026-04-22 13:03:25.547+00', 'Given a string containing only the characters ()[]{}, determine if the brackets are properly opened and closed in the correct order.', 'Input: s = "([{}])"
