	(44, 200, 'Number of Islands', 'medium', '{array,dfs,bfs,matrix,union-find}', '["雙層 for loop 掃格子，遇到 ''1'' 就觸發 dfs/bfs 並 count += 1", "把走過的 ''1'' 翻成 ''0'' — 當作 visited 標記", "四鄰是 (i±1, j) 跟 (i, j±1) — 不是寫死 0", "BFS 要在 enqueue 時就 mark，避免同一格被塞進 queue 多次", "Python BFS 用 collections.deque 跟 popleft()，pop(0) 是 O(n)"]', 'O(m×n) time, O(m×n) worst-case space', '["不能改 input？— 用 visited set 取代原地翻 ''0''", "大 grid 怕 recursion 爆掉？— 改 iterative BFS 用 deque", "想算最大島面積 — https://leetcode.com/problems/max-area-of-island/"]', '["recursion 在大 grid (如 1000×1000 全 land) 會打爆 Python default recursion limit", "mark-on-dequeue 不會算錯但會浪費 — 同一格可能被鄰居重複 enqueue"]', '2026-04-17 15:51:52.01224+00', '2026-04-23 16:12:23.052+00', 'Given an m×n grid of ''1'' (land) and ''0'' (water), return the number of connected islands. Cells connect 4-directionally.', 'Input: grid =
