	(60, 23, 'Merge k Sorted Lists', 'hard', '{linked-list,heap,divide-and-conquer,merge-sort}', '["Min-heap of list heads：每次 pop 最小，push 它的 next — O(n log k)", "Divide and conquer：pairwise merge，log k 輪 — 一樣 O(n log k)", "Heap push 要加 tiebreaker index：ListNode 本身不可比較", "用 dummy node + tail pointer 串結果，最後回傳 dummy.next"]', 'O(n log k) time, O(k) space (heap) — n = 總節點數, k = list 數', '["為什麼 heap 比 sequential merge 快？— 每個 node 只付 log k 的比較成本，不是 k", "Divide and conquer 的 stack 深度？— O(log k)，比 heap 版更省 heap 空間", "先練 Merge Two Sorted Lists — https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-two-sorted-lists/"]', '["heapq push (val, node) 遇到重複 val 會 crash — 要加 counter/index 當 tiebreaker", "全空的外層 list [None, None, None] 也要能處理，不是只有 lists = []"]', '2026-04-24 15:20:30.407224+00', '2026-05-05 14:31:21.962+00', 'Given an array of k sorted linked lists, merge them into one sorted linked list and return its head.', 'Input: lists = [[1,4,5],[1,3,4],[2,6]]
