[null,null,null,null,-3,null,0,-2]', '["別第三次又想用 heap — pop 是 LIFO 拿 top 不是拿 min，arbitrary heap delete 是 O(n)", "卡住時記住：每個位置存『push 當下的 min』，pop 自動 restore 前一個", "top() 是 peek 不是 pop — 別寫成 self.stack.pop()，會把元素吃掉"]', 2),
	(50, 11, 'Container With Most Water', 'medium', '{array,two-pointer,greedy}', '["Two-pointer from兩端夾，width = right - left", "area = min(h_left, h_right) × width", "每次移動較矮那邊 — 較矮是瓶頸，width 只會變小，唯一機會是換更高的 min", "h_left == h_right 時兩邊一起移也對 (但不必特別分支)"]', 'O(n) time, O(1) space', '["為什麼移較矮那邊？— 較高那邊配任何更近的線，min 仍被較矮那邊 cap，width 又變小，不可能贏", "Streaming 一次性讀入能解嗎？— 不行，最壞需 Ω(n) memory；用 monotonic stack 存嚴格遞增的 left-wall candidates，每來一根當 right wall 掃 stack", "下一題試 Trapping Rain Water — https://leetcode.com/problems/trapping-rain-water/"]', '["面積由較矮那邊決定，不是兩邊相加", "width 是 index 差，不是 index+1"]', '2026-04-19 15:39:49.967768+00', '2026-05-05 08:18:42.16+00', 'Given an array of non-negative heights representing vertical lines, find two lines that together with the x-axis form a container holding the most water.', 'Input: height = [1,8,6,2,5,4,8,3,7]
