	(51, 15, '3Sum', 'medium', '{array,two-pointer,sorting}', '["先 sort，再 fix i，對 i+1..n-1 做 two-pointer", "s < 0 → left++，s > 0 → right-- (sorted 才能這樣判斷)", "找到三元組後要同時推進 left 和 right，不然會無限迴圈", "三個位置都要去重：i, left, right 各自 skip 相同值", "Optimization: nums[i] > 0 就 break，三個正數不可能和為 0"]', 'O(n²) time, O(1) space (excluding output, ignoring sort stack)', '["為什麼 sort 是關鍵？— 才能用 two-pointer 判斷方向，也讓去重變成比對相鄰元素", "去重為什麼用值比對不是 index？— 題目要 unique triplets 是值層面的，不是位置", "4Sum 怎麼延伸？— 外面再多一層 loop，變 O(n³)"]', '["看似 medium 但細節密度像 hard — sort、三處去重、else 分支要雙指針同移", "i 的去重條件是 i > 0 and nums[i] == nums[i-1]，不是 nums[i] == nums[i+1]"]', '2026-04-20 13:57:20.260058+00', '2026-05-04 07:54:45.096+00', 'Given an integer array nums, return all unique triplets [a, b, c] such that a + b + c = 0. The solution set must not contain duplicate triplets.', 'Input: nums = [-1,0,1,2,-1,-4]
