	(66, 42, 'Trapping Rain Water', 'hard', '{array,two-pointer,dp,stack}', '["每個 i 的水量 = min(LMAX[i], RMAX[i]) - height[i]", "O(n) space: 兩個 pass 算出 LMAX 跟 RMAX 陣列，再 sum", "O(1) space: two-pointer 從兩端夾，永遠處理較矮那側", "Commit 邏輯: height[l] ≤ height[r] 時 lmax 就是 bottleneck，可以定案前進不用等 true rmax", "Mental model: 站在 i 往左右看最高牆，水位由較矮那面決定"]', 'O(n) time, O(1) space (two-pointer); O(n) time, O(n) space (prefix max)', '["如果是 stream 進來不能回頭？— 改用 monotonic stack", "2D 版本怎麼做？— https://leetcode.com/problems/trapping-rain-water-ii/", "同家族 ''move shorter side'': Container With Most Water — https://leetcode.com/problems/container-with-most-water/"]', '["LMAX/RMAX 要 include i 自己，不然 height[i] 比兩邊高時會算出負數", "暴力 O(n²) 對每個 i 重新掃左右最高 — prefix max 兩個 pass 就夠"]', '2026-05-05 10:21:57.857392+00', '2026-05-07 08:05:07.62+00', 'Given n non-negative integers representing an elevation map where each bar is width 1, compute how much water it can trap after raining.', 'Input: height = [0,1,0,2,1,0,1,3,2,1,2,1]
