	(56, 21, 'Merge Two Sorted Lists', 'easy', '{linked-list,recursion}', '["Merge pattern 模板：dummy + tail，while 兩邊都有就接小的 + 推進，迴圈外接剩餘尾巴", "tail = tail.next 抽到 if/else 外面只寫一次，別在兩個分支各寫", "迴圈結束後 tail.next = list1 or list2 — Pythonic 接上剩下那條", "Recursive 寫法：比小的那顆，其 .next = merge(剩下, 另一條)，回傳自己", "兩種寫法都是 O(n+m) time，差別在 space：iterative O(1) vs recursive O(n+m) stack"]', 'O(n+m) time; iterative O(1) space, recursive O(n+m) stack space', '["Production 選哪個？— Iterative dummy 版；Python recursion limit ~1000，長 list 會 stack overflow", "Merge k sorted lists？— Min-heap 取 k 個 head，或 divide-and-conquer 兩兩合併 — https://leetcode.com/problems/merge-k-sorted-lists/", "要不要複製節點？— 不用，splice 原節點，所以 O(1) aux space 才成立"]', '["比較用 <= 而非 < — 相等時保留 list1 在前 stability 較好，講出來加分", "Recursive 兩個分支的參數順序要一致 — 保持 (list1, list2) 的 invariant"]', '2026-04-22 12:00:03.996322+00', '2026-05-05 13:22:26.808+00', 'Given the heads of two sorted linked lists, merge them into one sorted linked list by splicing together their nodes.', 'Input: list1 = [1,2,4], list2 = [1,3,4]
