	(52, 53, 'Maximum Subarray', 'medium', '{array,dp,divide-and-conquer}', '["Kadane: running_sum = max(x, running_sum + x); best = max(best, running_sum)", "在每個 i 只有兩個選擇：延伸前面那條，或從 x 重開", "重開的時機是 running_sum 已經在 drag 下一個數字下來（running_sum < 0）", "O(n) time, O(1) space — 一邊掃一邊更新 best", "Init 兩種寫法：running_sum=nums[0] best=nums[0]，或 running_sum=0 best=-inf"]', 'O(n) time, O(1) space', '["要回傳 start/end index？— 在『重開』那條分支記下 start 位置", "Max Product Subarray？— 同時 track running max 跟 running min，負乘負會翻身 — https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-product-subarray/", "Circular array 版？— total - min_subarray vs Kadane max 取大的 — https://leetcode.com/problems/maximum-sum-circular-subarray/"]', '["best 不能 init 成 0 — 全負數會回傳 0，正解應該是最大的那個負數", "subarray 必須 contiguous，不能跳過負數挖洞"]', '2026-04-20 15:26:06.616075+00', '2026-05-07 14:54:45.089+00', 'Given an integer array nums, find the contiguous subarray with the largest sum and return that sum.', 'Input: nums = [-2,1,-3,4,-1,2,1,-5,4]
