	(61, 70, 'Climbing Stairs', 'easy', '{dp,math,recursion}', '["Recurrence: f(n) = f(n-1) + f(n-2) — Fibonacci with f(1)=1, f(2)=2", "為什麼不會重複算？— 用『最後一步』分割路徑：1-step 來自 n-1，2-step 來自 n-2，互斥又窮盡", "Memo 標準型：函式頂端 check 一次 → recurse → store → return，不要 call 前各自重複檢查", "Bottom-up 只需保留前兩個值 → O(1) space", "DP 四階段：naive recursion → memoization → tabulation → space-optimized"]', 'O(n) time, O(1) space (optimized); naive recursion O(2^n)', '["Steps {1,2,3}? — f(n)=f(n-1)+f(n-2)+f(n-3), 但 base case 也要更新 f(3)=4 (含 [3] 本身)", "Broken stairs? — 別分段思考，保留 recurrence 但 broken 處 dp[i]=0，零會自然往上傳遞", "下一題 House Robber — https://leetcode.com/problems/house-robber/"]', '["Java/C++ 大 n 會 integer overflow — Fibonacci 成長指數級，n=92 就爆 64-bit", "@lru_cache 直接裝飾 method 會把 self 變成 key — 用 nested helper 或 staticmethod"]', '2026-04-25 08:38:25.811524+00', '2026-05-08 03:49:01.5+00', 'Given n stairs, you can climb 1 or 2 steps at a time. Return the number of distinct ways to reach the top.', 'Input: n = 4
