	(39, 104, 'Maximum Depth of Binary Tree', 'easy', '{tree,dfs,bfs,recursion,binary-tree}', '["Recursive DFS：return 1 + max(maxDepth(left), maxDepth(right))", "Base case: node is None → return 0，leaf 自動被涵蓋不用特判", "相信遞迴會給你正確的 subtree 深度 — 只要加 1 就是自己", "BFS 分層：進 while 時先拍 len(queue) 快照，for _ in range(size) 只處理這一層", "另解：queue 存 (node, depth) tuple，免分層直接取 max(depth)"]', 'O(n) time. Space: DFS O(h), BFS O(w) — skewed 樹 BFS 反而 O(1) 贏', '["BFS vs DFS 哪個省 memory？— 看樹形狀：寬樹 DFS 贏 O(log n)，深/skewed 樹 BFS 贏 O(1)", "為什麼 balanced tree BFS 是 O(n)？— 最後一層節點數 ≈ n/2（等比級數：最末項 = 前面總和 + 1）", "Snapshot pattern 還有哪些題？— LC 102 (level order), 199 (right side view), 515 (largest in row)"]', '["max(left, right) 記得 +1 — 別忘了算自己這一層", "Skewed tree 會讓 Python recursion 爆 stack（default limit 1000）", "DFS space = O(h) call stack，BFS space = O(w) queue — 別籠統講 O(n)"]', '2026-04-16 12:01:30.844468+00', '2026-05-08 13:30:18.442+00', 'Given the root of a binary tree, return its maximum depth — the number of nodes along the longest path from root to the farthest leaf.', 'Input: root = [3,9,20,null,null,15,7]
